# shape" had been checked only against `derived/`'s own fixtures. This attempts
# `GenRecursor::build` and then `DepRecursor::build` at the decline point, over
# the checker's own `gen_ind` translation, and reports which of the two refuses.
# Memoised per declaration: `SCOPING.md` §2088 calls the pair the expensive one
# and `Lean.ParserDescr.rec` reaches the gate 254 times.
#
# The answer on `init-prelude` (2026-08-11) is **5 of 5 BOTH BUILD**.
